<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-13T15:50:13.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-2-linking-pages-78bdf4cd-cda7-40e4-a2ea-c20f696d248e",
        "text": "Our webpages are looking great with text and images, but what if we want to link to *other* pages or websites? That's where **hyperlinks** come in!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/05d9b0743bbe9d03ff582cbc03816069-test-lesson-2-linking-pages-panel-1-192aed55-2309-4ec0-af99-62de25edd0b2.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-2-linking-pages-2bb7271b-0bb8-4d4f-a5a0-f0963543a8da",
        "text": "We use the `<a>` tag (which stands for 'anchor') to create a hyperlink. Just like `<img>`, it has a special attribute: `href` (hypertext reference).",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/37c92513deaf8aa548a7002b964e6414-test-lesson-2-linking-pages-panel-2-f2217f02-eea5-4a78-835e-40e1f41ac238.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-2-linking-pages-607e443d-cdf1-4c8a-810c-bfdb394e425a",
        "text": "The `href` attribute is where you put the **destination** of your link. This could be a full web address, like `https://www.example.com` for an external website.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/76da3e04f7c114bb6130f8256c1b9a85-test-lesson-2-linking-pages-panel-3-6c6411cd-7dec-46d9-9d0d-b4b06b615aae.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-2-linking-pages-3fcfe93c-7255-4cc1-881a-3f90f2d007b9",
        "text": "Or, it could be a simpler path to another page *within your own website*, or even a specific section on the *same page*! This makes navigation easy.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/bd149a1b69d672db1471bdd236b32e7d-test-lesson-2-linking-pages-panel-4-52c8aac9-f21c-4d36-bdf7-21255d21db7b.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-2-linking-pages-577a018c-c1aa-4cce-a007-8a04a47366b6",
        "text": "When you put text or an image *between* the opening `<a>` and closing `</a>` tags, that content becomes clickable, taking users to the `href` destination!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/86eb80109b469a5f64cadf77d6864a22-test-lesson-2-linking-pages-panel-5-65cac8cc-e2bf-4df6-96a3-4d836c4724ef.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Introduce the <a> tag for creating hyperlinks. Explain the href attribute for defining the link destination, differentiating between external URLs and internal page anchors (or other local files)."
  },
  "published": true,
